# Unicode CLDR, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/ha/ca-gregorian.json.
# months.format.wide and months.format.abbreviated.
# CLDR spells February Faburairu; Nigerian written Hausa overwhelmingly
# writes Fabrairu, and both spellings ship because both are attested.
# The linked form is the genitive that a month name takes inside the date
# line ("watan faburairu 2027"); harvested from ha.wikipedia.org by a corpus
# count over the frame "watan <month>" (Fabrairu 12 / Fabrairun 8 / Faburairu 1).
faburairu
fab
fabrairu
fabrairun
faburairun
